# ANALYSIS INSTRUCTIONS

Analyze the resume against the job description using the following categories:

### 1. Core Skills & Technologies

Compare:

* Programming languages
* Cloud platforms
* Databases
* Data/DevOps/AI tools
* Frameworks
* Platforms
* Technologies
* Security/Governance tools
* Monitoring/Observability tools
* Any other technical requirements

### 2. Responsibilities

Determine whether the resume demonstrates experience performing the responsibilities mentioned in the job description.

### 3. Experience

Compare:

* Years of experience
* Relevant domain experience
* Production/support experience
* Project experience
* Leadership/ownership
* Industry/domain knowledge

### 4. Education & Certifications

Compare any required or preferred:

* Degrees
* Certifications
* Training
* Specialized qualifications

### 5. Soft Skills

Look for evidence of:

* Communication
* Problem solving
* Collaboration
* Stakeholder management
* Ownership
* Leadership
* Documentation
* Incident management

### 6. ATS Keyword Match

Identify important keywords and phrases from the job description and determine whether they appear:

* Exactly
* As a valid equivalent/synonym
* Indirectly through demonstrated experience
* Not at all

